  "number": 67,
  "text": "67.  Which of the following describes the changes in\n     forces of attraction that occur as H2O changes phase\n    from a liquid to a vapor?\n\n    A) H–O bonds break as H–H and O–O bonds\n         form.\n    B)  Hydrogen bonds between H2O molecules are\n         broken.\n    C)  Covalent bonds between H2O molecules are\n         broken.\n    D)  Ionic bonds between H+ ions and OH- ions are\n         broken.\n    E)  Covalent bonds between H+ ions and H2O\n         molecules become more effective.",
